 "design": "Each variant changes one standard heuristic@85 weight to half or double. It plays the standard policy in Axis attacks, seat-swapped pairs on the same 8 seeds as every other variant (4 temperate, 4 eastern): 24 variants x 16 games = 384 games. A pair's value is the mean over its two games from the variant's side, so map and side effects cancel; no self-play baseline is needed.",
 "power": "Per-pair SD of the variant-side margin in existing seat-swapped attack batches: about 1-4 VP eastern, 4-6 temperate, about 4 pooled; the spread of variant means beyond noise in those batches is about 2.6 VP. With 8 pairs a variant effect has SE about 1.4 VP (reliability about 0.67). With 24 variants, a true trial-level R2 of 0.5 gives an attenuated r about 0.58, Fisher interval about [0.18, 0.84]: detectable; a true R2 of 0.25 is borderline.",
 "groups": [
  {
   "name": "attack-temperate",
   "style": "TEMPERATE_INLAND",
   "start": 1600000,
   "matches": 8,
   "out": "artifacts/ai-surrogacy/{variant}/attack-temperate",
   "rows": "artifacts/ai-surrogacy/rows/{variant}__attack-temperate.jsonl",
   "command": "node scripts/ai-match.mjs --matches 8 --start 1600000 --style TEMPERATE_INLAND --engagement AXIS_ATTACKS --turns 8 --size 32x24 --divisions 6 --armored 2 --air NONE --air-transport NONE --swap --axis heuristic --parallel 4 --allied heuristic:artifacts/ai-surrogacy/weights/{variant}.json --out artifacts/ai-surrogacy/{variant}/attack-temperate"
